# Local working notes and gate evidence. `docs/` is deny-by-default so raw
# gate evidence and maintainer handover notes cannot be committed by accident;
# every document a clean clone needs is listed explicitly below. Use `docs/*`
# rather than `docs/`, because git does not descend into an excluded directory
# and the negations would otherwise never be considered.
init.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
docs/*
!docs/architecture.md
!docs/backend-parity.md
!docs/endpoint-registry.md
!docs/roadmap-features.md
!docs/status.md
!docs/testing.md
